{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22662","headline":"荅马侍御见赠 · 白居易","name":"荅马侍御见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谬入金门侍玉除，烦君问我意何如。\n蟠木讵堪明主用，笼禽徒与故人疎。\n苑花似雪同随辇，宫月如眉伴直庐。\n浅薄求贤思自代，嵇康莫寄绝交书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22662.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22662","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}